        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "传感器已到期。请尽快启用新的传感器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your sensor is malfunctioning. Start a new one as soon as possible." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "传感器出现故障。请尽快启用新的传感器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your sensor reports itself as not activated. Check that your sensor is nearby, or re-pair if this continues." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "传感器报告尚未激活。请确认传感器在附近。如果问题持续，请重新配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This could be due to compression or connection loss. Wait for it to resolve, or replace the sensor if it persists." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这可能是传感器受压或连接中断所致。请等待恢复。如果问题持续，请更换传感器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Readings have been unavailable for a while. This could be compression or connection loss, and it usually resolves on its own. Replace the sensor only if it persists." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已有一段时间未收到读数。这可能是传感器受压或连接中断所致，通常会自行恢复。只有在问题持续时才需要更换传感器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking your account for a sensor…" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
